Spec: Interoperable duplex business framing

Purpose:
  Preserve independent TCP directions and final acknowledgement over authenticated Java transports.

Owns:
  ./BusinessChannel.java

References:
  /contracts/dotnet/LinkGate.Control/BusinessStream.sdd

Must:
  Match the Windows length prefix, DATA, FIN, CLOSE and FIN acknowledgement frames.
  Reject oversized frames before payload allocation and bound each payload to `16384` bytes.
  Allow one application reader and writer while serializing internal acknowledgements without unbounded queues.
  Distinguish clean FIN from transport loss and never replay data after failure.
